  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TinyFlags 0.1.0-alpha.2\n\n      Added\n      - Typed feature-flag declarations via IFeatureProvider, with compile-time-generated access classes.\n      - Local-only FeatureValues store, or connect to a server through a transport package.\n      - Transport contracts (IFeatureDefinitionsTransport, IFeatureValuesTransport, IFeatureValuesSubscription)\n        any package can implement - see TinyFlags.Http and TinyFlags.Grpc for two real examples.\n      - Multi-assembly catalog composition via TinyFlagsBootstrap.\n      - Source-generator diagnostics (TFG001-TFG005) for unsupported declarations.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Early alpha: API surface, especially the transport contracts, may still change before 1.0.\n      - Upgrade TinyFlags, TinyFlags.Http and TinyFlags.Grpc together.",
